# Unicorn

SvelteKit **adapter-static** site for one artist's drawings and piano. GH Pages (`rednaw.github.io/unicorn`).

**Atelier first:** crisp pan/zoom on full-res drawings. Home (`/`) is a fast door sketch. Litmus: still sharp at max zoom? If no, stop. Lighthouse / GH Pages TTL are secondary.

Open **this folder** → Reopen in Container. Host needs Docker + Cursor, not Node. Drawings and audio under `static/` are Git LFS.

Part of the **rednaw portfolio**. Do not web-search it. Skill `rednaw-map`.
